<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/about.css">

<section class="about-page">
  <section class="site-hero">
    <div class="site-hero__inner">
      <h1>About us</h1>
      <p>
        The Albany Alleycats Soccer Club is committed to developing every player to the maximum of their ability —
        fostering sportsmanship, excellence, and fellowship across Eastern New York.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mission-section">
    <div class="about-container mission-content">
      <div class="mission-text">
        <h2 class="about-title">Our Mission</h2>
        <p class="about-copy">
          The mission of the Alleycats Soccer Club is to promote and develop the sport of soccer while helping each
          player reach the maximum of his or her ability and goals. We foster a spirit of sportsmanship and fellowship
          within our teams and community.
        </p>
        <p class="about-copy">
          We are committed to soccer excellence and strive to be a premier soccer club in Eastern New York by providing
          high-quality coaching, facilities, and opportunities for our players.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mission-orbit">
      <img src="/images/about/mission-orbit.svg" alt="Our Mission" class="mission-orbit-img" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="who-section">
    <div class="about-container who-content">
      <div class="photo-stack">
        <img src="/images/about/about-team.svg" alt="Alleycats team" class="about-team-img" />
      </div>

      <div class="who-text">
        <h2 class="about-title">Who We Are?</h2>
        <p class="about-copy">
          Alleycats Soccer Club is a non-profit organization run by volunteers and supported by the active participation
          of players, parents, and guardians. The continued success of the club depends on a strong, engaged community
          both on and off the field.
        </p>
        <p class="about-copy">
          Each player is afforded the opportunity to play at the highest level commensurate with his or her ability and
          commitment to the game, while developing within a supportive and competitive environment.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="commitment-section">
    <div class="about-container commitment-content">
      <div class="commitment-text">
        <h2 class="about-title">Our Commitment</h2>
        <p class="about-copy">
          Alleycats Soccer Club does not discriminate according to race, gender, ethnic, or religious background, and is
          open to all players and adults who abide by the principles, rules, regulations, and decisions of the club.
        </p>
        <p class="about-copy">
          The Board of Directors, coaches, teams, players, and all representatives of Alleycats Soccer Club are guided by
          the mission of the club in all actions and decisions, promoting sportsmanship, excellence, and community at
          every level.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="values-card">
        <img src="/images/about/values-card.svg" alt="Our Values" class="values-card-img" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</section>